WEBVTT

00:00:56.775 --> 00:01:01.225
But these euphoric episodes exceed
ordinary feelings of joy,

00:01:01.225 --> 00:01:03.847
causing troubling symptoms 
like racing thoughts,

00:01:03.847 --> 00:01:05.336
sleeplessness,

00:01:05.336 --> 00:01:06.516
rapid speech,

00:01:06.516 --> 00:01:07.962
impuslive actions,

00:01:07.962 --> 00:01:10.125
and risky behaviors.

00:01:10.125 --> 00:01:12.904
Without treatment, these episodes
become more frequent,

00:01:12.904 --> 00:01:13.827
intense,

00:01:13.827 --> 00:01:16.216
and take longer to subside.

00:01:16.216 --> 00:01:20.626
The depressed phase of bipolar disorder
manifests in many ways -

00:01:20.626 --> 00:01:21.657
a low mood,

00:01:21.657 --> 00:01:23.719
dwindling interest in hobbies,

00:01:23.719 --> 00:01:25.257
changes in appetite,

00:01:25.257 --> 00:01:27.857
feeling worthless or excessively guilty,

00:01:27.857 --> 00:01:30.147
sleeping either too much or too little,